\pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs20\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Robert Naumann, Heinrich Leberecht Fleischer, Franz Delitzsch: Catalogus Librorum Manuscriptorum Qui in Bibliotheca Senatoria Civitatis Lipsiensis Asservantur. Reproductio phototypica editionis Grimae, Gebhardt, 1838. Osnabr\u252 \'fcck 1985, S. 197.
