\pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs20\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls4\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Daniel Bellingradt und Bernd-Christian Otto: Magical Manuscripts in Early Modern Europe. The Clandestine Trade in Illegal Book Collections. Including a Critical Edition of a \ldblquote catalogus Rariorum Manuscriptorum\rdblquote  From 1710, Cham 2017, S. 147\endash 148.
